	(text_box "4 Pcs White LED, \nIF = 80mA (use this if need max brightness) \nVF = 3.0V \n\nVLEDK = VCC - VF = 3.3 - 3.0 = 0,3 V \nRLCD = VLEDK / IF = 0.3 / 80mA = 3.75 Ohm \n\nfor saver threshold on brightness and lcd\nlifetime use 4.7 Ohm (standard value) \nwhich equal to ~64mA\n"
